<title>THAILAND: Burma hails ASEAN membership decision.</title>
<headline>Burma hails ASEAN membership decision.</headline>
<byline>Rajan Moses</byline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-05-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Burma hailed ASEAN's decision on Saturday to admit it as a member of the regional grouping in July and vowed to work closely with the bloc.</p>
<p>The Association of South East Asian Nations (ASEAN) made the decision to admit Rangoon as well as Cambodia and Laos at a foreign ministers' meeting in Kuala Lumpur.</p>
